{"segment_id":"economy:0","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"moderator","role":"moderator","text":"I wanna begin tonight with the issue that voters repeatedly say is their number one issue, and that is the economy and the cost of living in this country.","t_start":0.0,"t_end":7.2,"stt_confidence":0.9907,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:1","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"moderator","role":"moderator","text":"Vice president Harris, you and president Trump were elected four years ago, and your opponent on the stage here tonight often asks his supporters, are you better off than you were four years ago?","t_start":7.3599997,"t_end":17.025,"stt_confidence":0.9863,"low_conf_words":["president"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:2","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"moderator","role":"moderator","text":"When it comes to the economy, do you believe Americans are better off than they were four years ago?","t_start":17.105,"t_end":21.505001,"stt_confidence":0.9963,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:3","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"So I was raised as a middle class kid, and I am actually the only person on this stage who has a plan that is about lifting up the middle class and working people of America.","t_start":21.985,"t_end":33.399998,"stt_confidence":0.9905,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:4","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"I believe in the ambition, the aspirations, the dreams of the American people, And that is why I imagine and have actually a plan to build what I call an opportunity economy.","t_start":33.8,"t_end":44.885,"stt_confidence":0.9778,"low_conf_words":["people","economy"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:5","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"Because here's the thing, we know that we have a a shortage of of homes and housing, and the cost of housing is too expensive for far too many people.","t_start":45.045,"t_end":53.205,"stt_confidence":0.9817,"low_conf_words":["thing"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:6","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"We know that young families need support to raise their children, and I intend on extending a tax cut for those families of $6,000, which is the largest child tax credit that we have given in a long time so that those young families can afford to buy a crib, buy a car seat, buy clothes for their children.","t_start":53.75,"t_end":73.91499,"stt_confidence":0.9919,"low_conf_words":["so"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:7","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"My passion, one of them, is small businesses.","t_start":74.555,"t_end":78.155,"stt_confidence":0.9832,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:8","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"I was actually...","t_start":78.155,"t_end":79.115,"stt_confidence":0.9948,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:9","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"My mother raised my sister and me, but there was a woman who helped raise us.","t_start":79.115,"t_end":83.0,"stt_confidence":0.9939,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:10","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"We call her our second mother.","t_start":83.0,"t_end":84.44,"stt_confidence":0.9964,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:11","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"She was a small business owner.","t_start":84.44,"t_end":85.8,"stt_confidence":0.9998,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:12","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"I love our small businesses.","t_start":85.8,"t_end":87.4,"stt_confidence":0.9999,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:13","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"My plan is to give a $50,000 tax deduction to start up small businesses knowing they are part of the backbone of America's economy.","t_start":87.8,"t_end":97.145004,"stt_confidence":0.9928,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:14","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"My opponent on the other hand, his plan is to do what he has done before, which is to provide a tax cut for billionaires and big corporations, which will result in $5,000,000,000,000 to America's deficit.","t_start":97.545,"t_end":110.44,"stt_confidence":0.98,"low_conf_words":["on"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:15","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"My opponent has a plan that I call the Trump's sales tax, which would be a 20% tax on everyday goods that you rely on to get through the month.","t_start":110.520004,"t_end":120.44,"stt_confidence":0.9919,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:16","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"Economists have said that that Trump sales tax would actually result for middle class families in about $4,000 more a year because of his policies and his ideas about what should be the backs of middle class people paying for tax cuts for billionaires.","t_start":121.065,"t_end":140.47002,"stt_confidence":0.9914,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:17","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"moderator","role":"moderator","text":"President Trump, I'll give you two minutes.","t_start":140.79001,"t_end":142.55002,"stt_confidence":0.9944,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:18","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"First of all, I have no sales tax.","t_start":142.63,"t_end":144.63,"stt_confidence":0.995,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:19","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"That's an incorrect statement.","t_start":144.63,"t_end":145.83,"stt_confidence":0.9965,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:20","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"She knows that.","t_start":145.83,"t_end":146.79001,"stt_confidence":0.982,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:21","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"We're doing tariffs on other countries.","t_start":147.19,"t_end":149.03,"stt_confidence":0.9955,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:22","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"Other countries are gonna finally, after seventy five years, pay us back for all that we've done for the world, and the tariff will be substantial in some cases.","t_start":149.03,"t_end":158.815,"stt_confidence":0.9789,"low_conf_words":["finally","world"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:23","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"I took in billions and billions of dollars, as you know, from China.","t_start":158.815,"t_end":162.095,"stt_confidence":0.9883,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:24","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"In fact, they never took the tariff off because it was so much money they can't.","t_start":162.25499,"t_end":165.535,"stt_confidence":0.9656,"low_conf_words":["it"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:25","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"It would totally destroy everything that they've set out to do.","t_start":165.78,"t_end":169.14,"stt_confidence":0.9972,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:26","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"They're taking in billions of dollars from China and other places they've left the tariffs on.","t_start":169.14,"t_end":173.54001,"stt_confidence":0.9693,"low_conf_words":["they've"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:27","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"When I had it, I had tariffs and yet I had no inflation.","t_start":173.62,"t_end":176.5,"stt_confidence":0.9538,"low_conf_words":["and"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:28","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"Look.","t_start":177.06,"t_end":177.62,"stt_confidence":0.8994,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:29","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"We've had a terrible economy because inflation has...","t_start":177.62,"t_end":181.22499,"stt_confidence":0.9948,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:30","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"Which is really known as a country buster.","t_start":181.22499,"t_end":182.98499,"stt_confidence":0.9834,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:31","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"It breaks up countries.","t_start":182.98499,"t_end":184.345,"stt_confidence":0.9984,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:32","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"We have inflation like very few people have ever seen before, probably the worst in our nation's history.","t_start":184.50499,"t_end":190.34499,"stt_confidence":0.9811,"low_conf_words":["before"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:33","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"We were at 21%, but that's being generous because many things are 50, 60, 70, and 80% higher than they were just a few years ago.","t_start":190.88,"t_end":199.20001,"stt_confidence":0.9871,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:34","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"This has been a disaster for people, for the middle class, but for every class.","t_start":199.28,"t_end":203.28001,"stt_confidence":0.9861,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:35","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"On top of that, we have millions of people pouring into our country from prisons and jails, from mental institutions and insane asylums.","t_start":203.36,"t_end":212.215,"stt_confidence":0.9722,"low_conf_words":["and"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:36","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"And they're coming in and they're taking jobs that are occupied right now by African Americans and Hispanics and also unions.","t_start":212.295,"t_end":220.47,"stt_confidence":0.9572,"low_conf_words":["and","and"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:37","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"Unions are gonna be affected very soon.","t_start":220.47,"t_end":222.39,"stt_confidence":0.9545,"low_conf_words":["soon"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:38","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"And you see what's happening.","t_start":222.39,"t_end":223.67,"stt_confidence":0.9913,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:39","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"You see what's happening with towns throughout The United States.","t_start":223.67,"t_end":226.47,"stt_confidence":0.9989,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:40","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"You look at Springfield, Ohio.","t_start":226.47,"t_end":228.47,"stt_confidence":0.9885,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:41","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"You look at Aurora in Colorado.","t_start":228.47,"t_end":230.87,"stt_confidence":0.9932,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:42","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"They are taking over the towns.","t_start":231.335,"t_end":233.015,"stt_confidence":0.9957,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:43","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"They're taking over buildings.","t_start":233.015,"t_end":234.375,"stt_confidence":0.9899,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:44","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"They're going in violently.","t_start":234.375,"t_end":235.975,"stt_confidence":0.9998,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:45","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"These are the people that she and Biden led into our country, and they're destroying our country.","t_start":236.05501,"t_end":242.77501,"stt_confidence":0.9679,"low_conf_words":["led"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:46","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"They're dangerous.","t_start":242.77501,"t_end":244.05501,"stt_confidence":0.9559,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:47","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"They're at the highest level of criminality, and we have to get them out.","t_start":244.05501,"t_end":247.99,"stt_confidence":0.9938,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:48","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"We have to get them out fast.","t_start":247.99,"t_end":249.35,"stt_confidence":0.9994,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:49","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"I created one of the greatest economies in the history of our country.","t_start":249.43001,"t_end":253.43001,"stt_confidence":0.9997,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:50","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"I'll do it again and even better.","t_start":253.75,"t_end":255.43001,"stt_confidence":0.9931,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:51","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"moderator","role":"moderator","text":"We are gonna get to immigration and border security during this debate, but, I would like to let vice president Harris respond on the economy here.","t_start":255.43001,"t_end":262.15,"stt_confidence":0.9879,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:52","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"Well, I would love to.","t_start":262.585,"t_end":263.94498,"stt_confidence":0.9925,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:53","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"Let's talk about what Donald Trump left us.","t_start":263.94498,"t_end":267.465,"stt_confidence":0.9998,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:54","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"Donald Trump left us the worst unemployment since the Great Depression.","t_start":267.865,"t_end":273.145,"stt_confidence":0.9596,"low_conf_words":["Great"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:55","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"Donald Trump left us the worst public health epidemic in a century.","t_start":273.465,"t_end":279.33,"stt_confidence":0.9996,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:56","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"Donald Trump left us the worst attack on our democracy since the civil war.","t_start":279.65,"t_end":286.85,"stt_confidence":0.9694,"low_conf_words":["civil","war"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:57","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"And what we have done is clean up Donald Trump's mess.","t_start":287.41,"t_end":290.61,"stt_confidence":0.9953,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:58","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"What we have done and what I intend to do is build on what we know are the aspirations and the hopes of the American people.","t_start":291.185,"t_end":297.745,"stt_confidence":0.9921,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:59","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"But I'm gonna tell you all in this debate tonight, you're gonna hear from the same old tired playbook a bunch of lies, grievances, and name calling.","t_start":297.745,"t_end":307.18002,"stt_confidence":0.9468,"low_conf_words":["you","all","in"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:60","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"What you're gonna hear tonight is a detailed and dangerous plan called project twenty twenty five that the former president intends on implementing if he were elected to Genn.","t_start":307.26,"t_end":317.66,"stt_confidence":0.9677,"low_conf_words":["project","to","Genn"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:61","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"I believe very strongly that the American people want a president who understands the importance of bringing us together knowing we have so much more in common than what separates us, and I pledge to you to be a president for all Americans.","t_start":318.605,"t_end":332.685,"stt_confidence":0.9828,"low_conf_words":["knowing","us"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:62","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"moderator","role":"moderator","text":"President Trump, I'll give you a minute here to respond.","t_start":332.685,"t_end":334.5,"stt_confidence":0.9708,"low_conf_words":["Trump"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:63","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"Number one, I have nothing to do.","t_start":334.5,"t_end":335.94,"stt_confidence":0.983,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:64","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"As you know and as she knows better than anyone, I have nothing to do with project twenty twenty five.","t_start":335.94,"t_end":340.74002,"stt_confidence":0.9696,"low_conf_words":["and"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:65","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"That's out there.","t_start":341.06,"t_end":342.1,"stt_confidence":0.9992,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:66","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"I haven't read it.","t_start":342.18002,"t_end":343.06,"stt_confidence":0.9982,"low_conf_words":[]}
