{"segment_id":"economy:68","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"I'm not going to read it.","t_start":344.58002,"t_end":345.7,"stt_confidence":0.9997,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:69","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"This was a group of people that got together.","t_start":345.7,"t_end":347.54,"stt_confidence":0.9951,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:70","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"They came up with some ideas.","t_start":347.54,"t_end":348.90002,"stt_confidence":0.9735,"low_conf_words":["ideas"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:71","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"I guess some good, some bad, but it makes no difference.","t_start":348.90002,"t_end":351.835,"stt_confidence":0.9584,"low_conf_words":["some"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:72","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"I have nothing to do.","t_start":351.835,"t_end":352.875,"stt_confidence":1.0,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:73","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"Everybody knows I'm an open book.","t_start":352.875,"t_end":354.395,"stt_confidence":0.9788,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:74","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"Everybody knows what I'm gonna do.","t_start":354.395,"t_end":355.75497,"stt_confidence":0.9628,"low_conf_words":["do"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:75","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"Cut taxes very substantially and create a great economy like I did before.","t_start":355.75497,"t_end":360.235,"stt_confidence":0.9852,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:76","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"We had the greatest economy.","t_start":360.395,"t_end":361.995,"stt_confidence":0.9944,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:77","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"We got hit with a pandemic, and the pandemic was not since 1917 where a hundred million people died has there been anything like it.","t_start":361.995,"t_end":370.01,"stt_confidence":0.9625,"low_conf_words":["pandemic","where","has"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:78","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"We did a phenomenal job with the pandemic.","t_start":370.01,"t_end":372.41003,"stt_confidence":0.9858,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:79","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"We handed them over a country where the economy and where the stock market was higher than it was before the pandemic came in.","t_start":372.65002,"t_end":380.57498,"stt_confidence":0.9963,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:80","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"Nobody's ever seen anything like it.","t_start":380.81497,"t_end":382.655,"stt_confidence":0.9962,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:81","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"We made ventilators for the entire world.","t_start":382.655,"t_end":385.215,"stt_confidence":0.9989,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:82","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"We got gowns.","t_start":385.215,"t_end":386.175,"stt_confidence":0.9828,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:83","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"We got masks.","t_start":386.175,"t_end":387.055,"stt_confidence":0.9993,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:84","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"We did things that nobody thought possible.","t_start":387.055,"t_end":389.13498,"stt_confidence":0.9854,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:85","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"And people give me credit for rebuilding the military.","t_start":389.215,"t_end":391.775,"stt_confidence":0.9958,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:86","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"They give me credit for a lot of things, but not enough credit for the great job we did with the pandemic.","t_start":391.775,"t_end":396.80002,"stt_confidence":0.9931,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:87","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"But the only jobs they got were bounce back jobs.","t_start":396.80002,"t_end":399.2,"stt_confidence":0.9692,"low_conf_words":["bounce"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:88","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"These were jobs bounce back, and it bounced back, and it went to their benefit.","t_start":399.2,"t_end":403.6,"stt_confidence":0.9484,"low_conf_words":["bounce","back","benefit"]}
{"segment_id":"economy:89","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"But I was the one that created them.","t_start":403.76,"t_end":405.52002,"stt_confidence":0.999,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:90","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"trump","role":"speaker","text":"They know it, and so does everybody else.","t_start":405.52002,"t_end":407.28,"stt_confidence":0.9841,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:91","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"moderator","role":"moderator","text":"Vice president Harris, I'll let you respond.","t_start":407.28,"t_end":408.64,"stt_confidence":0.9794,"low_conf_words":[]}
{"segment_id":"economy:92","session_id":"economy","speaker_id":"harris","role":"speaker","text":"So Donald Trump has no plan for you.","t_start":409.505,"t_end":413.105,"stt_confidence":0.9889,"low_conf_words":[]}
